<h1 class="nm-h1" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;line-height:34px;font-weight:600;color:#1B2B4B;">
  We couldn't process your payment
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;">
  The {{amount}} charge for your <strong>{{planName}}</strong> plan didn't go through.
  {{#if reason}}Your bank reported: <em>{{reason}}</em>.{{/if}}
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;color:#4B5563;">
  Your account is still active for now. Update your payment method to avoid losing
  premium features on {{graceEndsOn}}.
</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="nm-cta" style="margin:0 0 8px;">
  <tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#1B2B4B" style="border-radius:8px;">
    <a href="{{retryUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Update payment method</a>
  </td></tr>
</table>
